  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Volatile global, political and economic environment'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'R'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'The volatility of geo-political events and macroeconomic changes,\nsuch as wars, adverse trade policies and continuing high inflation in\nmajor economies can impact client spending and squeeze liquidity.\nSuch developments could weaken the business outlook for TCS’\ncustomers, leading to demand uncertainty for the Company’s\nservices and a higher cost of doing business. In addition, risks\nrelating to service delivery, business continuity, cybersecurity,\nsanctions compliance and human rights in geo-politically sensitive\nzones may increase costs and impact revenue growth.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'Broad-based business mix with diversified focus across\ngeographies and industry verticals and targeting CxO business\nin addition to CIOs aid in balancing the risk impact. Active\nmonitoring of the changing geo-political landscape, ensuring\nbusiness continuity plans and strengthening internal controls\nagainst secondary risks continue.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Negative Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Disruptive Technologies'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues2)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'R'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues2)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'Technology disruption is happening at an unprecedented pace.\nInadequate guardrails and governance to address inherent risks\nof use of emerging technology can cause significant quality,\nsecurity, IP and ethical concerns. GenAI technologies could disrupt\nexisting software development methods, causing unrealistic\nmarket expectations in the short term, impacting TCS’ value\nproposition, resulting in competitive disadvantage and impact on\nthe Company’s growth prospects.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues2)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'Investments in large-scale re-skilling of TCS associates on AI and other\nnew technologies are progressing well. The Company has developed\na future-ready workforce by providing all associates with foundational\nAI and GenAI awareness training, while a significant proportion of\nemployees have also acquired advanced AI capabilities.\nIn parallel, TCS continues to invest in innovation across\nframeworks, methods, guardrails to address risks, investments\nin the required infrastructure and safe environments are being\nmade. This is complemented by strategic partnerships and\ncontinued investment in research and innovation to ensure secure\nand scalable adoption. Across every service line, the Company is\nworking on service transformation using AI. There is an increasing\nfocus on building, partnering or acquiring capabilities required to\nadapt to customer requirements.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues2)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Negative Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues2)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Disruptive Technologies'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues3)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'O'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues3)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'Technology disruption is happening at an unprecedented pace.\nInadequate guardrails and governance to address inherent risks\nof use of emerging technology can cause significant quality,\nsecurity, IP and ethical concerns. GenAI technologies could disrupt\nexisting software development methods, causing unrealistic\nmarket expectations in the short term, impacting TCS’ value\nproposition, resulting in competitive disadvantage and impact on\nthe Company’s growth prospects.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues3)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'TCS is uniquely positioned to help customers navigate increasing\ncomplexity across technology, operating models and business\ntransformation. Through its five-pillar transformation framework,\ncombined with sustained investments spanning ‘Infrastructure\nto Intelligence’, the Company continues to strengthen its AI-led\nengineering capabilities, scalable and highly skilled talent base,\ndifferentiated solutions portfolio and robust partner ecosystem.\nThese capabilities enable TCS to help customers reimagine\ncustomer experiences, improve productivity and drive meaningful\ntransformation across their organisations.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues3)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Positive Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues3)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Ability to attract and retain top talent; short supply of emerging\ntechnical skills'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues4)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'R'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues4)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'For the IT services industry, sustained organisational growth\ndepends on the ability to attract, develop, motivate and retain\nskilled talent. TCS’ strategic transition towards becoming an AIfirst\nenterprise is fundamentally dependent on building a globally\nscalable and future-ready workforce enhanced by AI capabilities.\nIntensifying global competition for specialised AI talent may\nincrease attrition levels, creating challenges in retaining critical\nexpertise required to drive transformation initiatives.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues4)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'Huge investments in talent engagement, development with the\nfocus of re-skilling to adapt to new and emerging technologies\nhave been made and continue at a rapid pace. This includes\nmassive investments in structured, role-based learning pathways\nto equip every employee with AI skills. Talent retention is further\nsupported through reward and recognition programmes, career\ndevelopment opportunities and continuous learning initiatives.\nTCS has expanded business delivery centres to tier-2/tier-3 cities\nin India to enable leveraging local talent supply and diversification\nalso aids in addressing the talent risk. Investments are also made\nin branding, STEM/GoIT programmes and campus engagements in\nglobal markets, to improve local hiring and retention.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues4)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Negative Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues4)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Business model changes'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues5)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'R'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues5)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'Advancements in foundational models by deep tech AI companies\nand their capabilities could fundamentally transform business\nmodels and pricing models. Emerging foundational models are\nlikely to further replace or augment traditional offerings in the\nfuture. As a result, clients may increasingly delay or reconsider\ninvestments under current contracts and engagements as they\nassess the potential impact and value of these rapidly advancing\ntechnologies. Such delays in spending and contract commitments\ncan adversely affect the Company’s operational results, particularly\nif TCS is unable to rapidly adapt its pricing, commercial models,\nand value propositions to align with the benefits and efficiencies\ndelivered by new foundational technologies. In addition, if\nspending growth associated with these technologies does not\nsufficiently offset potential declines in traditional service revenues,\nthe Company could face revenue pressures.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues5)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'TCS closely monitors advancements in foundational AI models\nand proactively adapts service offerings, delivery models, and\ncommercial structures. Investments in building patterns and\nframeworks, fine tuned SLM models to build contextualised\nsolutions for customers. In parallel, TCS engages customers\nthrough immersion sessions and rapid-build demonstrations to\nshowcase practical AI use cases, accelerate decision-making and\nsupport scaled enterprise adoption.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues5)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Negative Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues5)"
  },
  {
