    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues6)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'Advancements in foundational models by deep tech AI companies\nand their capabilities could fundamentally transform business\nmodels and pricing models. Emerging foundational models are\nlikely to further replace or augment traditional offerings in the\nfuture. As a result, clients may increasingly delay or reconsider\ninvestments under current contracts and engagements as they\nassess the potential impact and value of these rapidly advancing\ntechnologies. Such delays in spending and contract commitments\ncan adversely affect the Company’s operational results, particularly\nif TCS is unable to rapidly adapt its pricing, commercial models,\nand value propositions to align with the benefits and efficiencies\ndelivered by new foundational technologies. In addition, if\nspending growth associated with these technologies does not\nsufficiently offset potential declines in traditional service revenues,\nthe Company could face revenue pressures.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues6)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'Growing capabilities of foundational AI models increases demand\nfor service providers who can contextualize, integrate, and fine tune\ngeneric models for enterprise grade adoption at scale.\nThis creates opportunities for TCS to expand into higher-value\nservices spanning AI consulting, transformation, platform integration\nand managed AI operations.\nThe evolving technology landscape also presents opportunities to\ndeepen long-term customer relationships and participate in new\ntechnology-led investment cycles as AI adoption matures across\nindustries.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues6)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Positive Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues6)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Restrictions on global mobility, location strategies'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues7)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'R'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues7)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'The Company’s global delivery model depends on the crossborder\nmobility of skilled professionals. Consequently, regulatory\nrestrictions in key markets may limit access to specialised talent,\nconstrain capability expansion, increase the cost of doing business\nand potentially delay client project execution.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues7)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'Diversified sourcing and local hiring strategies, supported by\nstrong employer branding and multi-channel access to active\nand passive talent pools. Increased hiring of local talent and\npromoting local talent building in STEM areas help to materially\nreduce dependency on work visas.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues7)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Negative Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues7)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Cyber Attacks'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues8)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'R'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues8)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'Cyber security threats continue to evolve rapidly, with the\nfrequency and sophistication of cyber-attacks increasing\nsignificantly. Such threats may arise from geopolitical\ndevelopments, pandemic-themed cyber campaigns and other\nemerging vulnerabilities. Security breaches can result in\nreputational damage, operational disruption, regulatory penalties,\nand legal and financial liabilities for TCS.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues8)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'To strengthen cyber resilience, TCS continues to invest in stateof-\nthe-art security operations centres supported by automated\nresponse playbooks. The Company maintains stringent security\npolicies, procedures and controls aligned with ISO 27001 standards,\ncomplemented by enterprise-wide awareness and training\nprogrammes as well as regular internal and external audits. Use\nof advanced AI/ML based tools to detect and prevent incursions\nwith advanced quarantine capabilities, including perimeter security\ncontrols with enhanced internal vulnerability detection, data leak\nprevention tools, incident management and recovery process, red\n/ purple teaming, ‘breach-and-attack’ simulations in compliance\nwith industry best practices are implemented. Close collaboration\nwith Computer Emergency Response Team (CERT) and other\nprivate cyber intelligence agencies help to stay ahead of the curve.\nIn addition, cyber insurance coverage is maintained to address\nresidual risk exposure.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues8)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Negative Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues8)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Cyber Attacks'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues9)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'O'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues9)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'Cyber security threats continue to evolve rapidly, with the\nfrequency and sophistication of cyber-attacks increasing\nsignificantly. Such threats may arise from geopolitical\ndevelopments, pandemic-themed cyber campaigns and other\nemerging vulnerabilities. Security breaches can result in\nreputational damage, operational disruption, regulatory penalties,\nand legal and financial liabilities for TCS.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues9)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'It is imperative for all enterprises to create robust and proactive\ncyber resilience strategies to address increasing threats. This\npresents opportunities for TCS to modernise security operations,\nstrengthening cyber defence and cyber offence capabilities,\nexpanding GenAI and cloud-based security offerings, and preparing\nfor future risks associated with quantum computing-driven attacks.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues9)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Positive Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues9)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Non-compliance to complex and changing global regulations'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues10)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'R'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues10)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'TCS’ global nature of operations requires it to comply with\never-evolving, complex regulatory requirements across multiple\njurisdictions and compliance areas. Failure to comply can result in\npenalties, reputational damage, and criminal prosecution.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues10)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'The Company has established a centralised programme for horizon\nscanning and monitoring regulatory developments globally.\nThis is supported by an enterprise-wide compliance framework\nthat integrates regulatory requirements into policies, processes\nand internal controls. Continued focus on fostering an ethical\nand compliance culture, with governance at Board, executive\nand management levels through quarterly declarations, risk\nassessments and audits enable the Company to stay compliant\nin an ever-changing environment. Where feasible, automated\npreventive controls — such as real-time sanctions screening — are\nimplemented to minimise the risk of non-compliance.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues10)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Negative Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues10)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Non-compliance to complex and changing\nglobal regulations'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues11)"
  },
  {
