    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues11)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'TCS’ global nature of operations requires it to comply with\never-evolving, complex regulatory requirements across multiple\njurisdictions and compliance areas. Failure to comply can result in\npenalties, reputational damage, and criminal prosecution.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues11)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'As regulatory frameworks continue to evolve across industries and\ngeographies, enterprises are increasingly required to strengthen\ntheir compliance programmes and governance structures. TCS\nprovides Governance, Risk and Compliance (GRC) services and\nofferings to enterprises in various industry compliance domains,\nespecially regulated industries.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues11)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Positive Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues11)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Intellectual Property (IP) infringement and leakage'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues12)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'R'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues12)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'Risk of infringement of IP of customers, suppliers, partners and\nalliance organisations by TCS associates may lead to potential\nliabilities, increased litigation and reputation impact.\nUsing AI without the right guardrails additionally presents risks,\nincluding the potential for copyright infringement and confidential\ndata input into public models. Also, inadequate protection of TCS’\nIP may lead to potential loss of ownership rights, revenue and\nvalue.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues12)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'To address these risks, TCS has implemented a comprehensive IP policy\nand an industry-leading IP management framework encompassing\nthe creation, protection, assetisation, commercialisation, usage and\ngovernance of intellectual property. These measures are further\nsupported through extensive IP awareness and training initiatives\nacross the organisation.\nOnly ‘IP Safe’ certified TCS intellectual property assets are positioned\nand marketed to customers. In addition, process- and system-based\ncontrols ensure appropriate access to and usage of TCS, customer\nand third-party IP across internal operations and customer delivery\nengagements, including AI-based systems.\nEmployee IP and confidentiality agreements, organisational structures\ndesigned to prevent IP contamination and infringement, and quarterly\nIP compliance declarations by product teams further strengthen the\nCompany’s IP governance framework and minimise associated risks.\nTCS continues to foster and reward a strong culture of innovation\nacross the organisation, reflected in the growing number of patents\ngranted to the Company. This continued focus on innovation\nstrengthens its intellectual property portfolio and supports the\ndevelopment of differentiated solutions and long-term value creation.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues12)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Negative Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues12)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Data protection & privacy compliance'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues13)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'R'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues13)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'The global nature of TCS’ operations requires compliance with a\nwide range of data privacy regulations across jurisdictions, many of\nwhich carry significant penalties for violations and data breaches.\nPrivacy-related risks have further intensified with the widespread\ndemocratisation of AI adoption and the rapid proliferation\nof advanced AI tools. Any breach of privacy regulations or\ncompromise of sensitive data could adversely affect the Company’s\noperations, reputation and financial position through material\nliabilities and regulatory actions.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues13)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'TCS’ global privacy policy is implemented through the PriVACE\nframework and a robust organisational structure comprising the\nGlobal Privacy Office, Geography level DPOs, and Business Privacy\nLeaders. The Company continuously monitors the evolving regulatory\nlandscape to track emerging privacy-related requirements, including\ndevelopments such as India’s Digital Personal Data Protection Act\n(DPDPA). Training and awareness is key, with data privacy training\nmandated for all associates.\nData protection controls are implemented and assessed\nthrough internal and third-party external audits across all the\nareas of operations.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues13)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Negative Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues13)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Data protection & privacy compliance'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues14)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'O'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues14)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'The global nature of TCS’ operations requires compliance with a\nwide range of data privacy regulations across jurisdictions, many of\nwhich carry significant penalties for violations and data breaches.\nPrivacy-related risks have further intensified with the widespread\ndemocratisation of AI adoption and the rapid proliferation\nof advanced AI tools. Any breach of privacy regulations or\ncompromise of sensitive data could adversely affect the Company’s\noperations, reputation and financial position through material\nliabilities and regulatory actions.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues14)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'As enterprises continue to increase investments in strengthening\ndata privacy and governance frameworks, significant growth\nopportunities are emerging for TCS in the area of data privacy\nservices and solutions. This opportunity is expected to expand\nfurther in markets such as India following the introduction of new\nprivacy regulations.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues14)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Positive Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues14)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Sustainability Risks – Climate change & Environmental aspects'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues15)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'R'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues15)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'With globally distributed operations, TCS is vulnerable to physical\nrisks arising from climate change, such as disruptions to operations\ndue to climate catastrophes, water scarcity across water stressed\nlocations, resource constraints, among others. TCS also faces transition\nrisks considering a global shift towards a low carbon economy due\nto evolving policies, regulations, market demand, technology and\nstakeholder expectations. Physical climate-related risks may adversely affect the health and safety\nof local communities, disrupt business continuity and impact supply\nchain operations. In parallel, transition risks associated with the shift\ntowards a low-carbon economy could influence TCS’ growth prospects,\nprofitability and reputation.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues15)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'TCS has conducted a climate risk assessment through climate scenarios\nto assess the physical and transition risks over short, medium and long\nterm. The Company ensures implementation of mitigating controls by\nmeans of timely engagement with internal and external stakeholders,\ncontinuous alignment with evolving national and international\nregulations, and integration of management system requirements into\nbusiness operations. The Company has reinforced initiatives across\nenergy efficiency, carbon management, water management, waste management, preserving biodiversity in campuses, and supply chain\nsustainability to ensure ongoing relevance, effective implementation\nand sustained compliance across the organisation.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues15)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Negative Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues15)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Sustainability Risks – Climate change & Environmental aspects'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues16)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'O'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues16)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'With globally distributed operations, TCS is vulnerable to physical\nrisks arising from climate change, such as disruptions to operations\ndue to climate catastrophes, water scarcity across water stressed\nlocations, resource constraints, among others. TCS also faces transition\nrisks considering a global shift towards a low carbon economy due\nto evolving policies, regulations, market demand, technology and\nstakeholder expectations. Physical climate-related risks may adversely affect the health and safety\nof local communities, disrupt business continuity and impact supply\nchain operations. In parallel, transition risks associated with the shift\ntowards a low-carbon economy could influence TCS’ growth prospects,\nprofitability and reputation.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues16)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'Across major global markets, sustainability has decisively moved\nbeyond compliance and purpose-led initiatives to become a core\nbusiness strategy. Enterprises are now viewing sustainability\nthrough the lens of resilience, efficiency, and value creation.\nAgainst this backdrop, TCS’s targeted investments in products,\nservices, and strategic partnerships are enabling new, scalable\ngrowth streams for clients and the enterprise.\nFor more information on TCS Climate risks and opportunities,\nrefer to TCS IFRS S2 report at https://www.tcs.com/investor-relations/corporate-sustainability-investor-relations.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues16)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Positive Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues16)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Litigation risks'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues17)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'R'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues17)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'Litigation risks may arise from commercial disputes, alleged\nintellectual property rights (IPR) violations, personal data or\ninformation breach incidents, and employment-related matters. In\naddition, the increasing scale and market profile of TCS may make\nthe Company more susceptible to opportunistic or meritless legal\nclaims. Such matters may lead to reputation risk, legal expenses\nand adverse rulings which can result in substantive damages.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues17)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'To mitigate these risks, TCS has established robust processes,\ncontrols and governance mechanisms focused on compliance\nwith contractual obligations, information security standards, IP\nprotection policies and immigration regulations.\nThe Company has also strengthened its network of in-house legal\ncounsel across major geographies, supported by reputed global\nlaw firms in regions where it operates. In addition, arbitration\nmechanisms have increasingly been incorporated into contractual\narrangements as an alternative to court proceedings, along with\nwaivers of jury trials, particularly within the US market.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues17)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Negative Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues17)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Currency volatility'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues18)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'R'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues18)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'Volatility in INR, which serves as the functional currency for\nTCS, against major global currencies may result in fluctuations\nin reported revenue, profitability and operating margins. Such\ncurrency movements may also influence stakeholder perceptions\nregarding the underlying momentum and profitability of the\nbusiness.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues18)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'To limit impact of short-term exchange volatility, the currency\nhedging policy aligned with best practices is in place. Hedging\nstrategies are guided and monitored by the Risk Management\nCommittee of the Board. Management commentary is based\non constant currency for better stakeholder understanding of\nbusiness performance.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues18)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Negative Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues18)"
  },
