  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'StatementByDirectorResponsibleForTheBusinessResponsibilityReportHighlightingESGRelatedChallengesTargetsAndAchievementsExplanatoryTextBlock' (StatementByDirectorResponsibleForTheBusinessResponsibilityReportHighlightingESGRelatedChallengesTargetsAndAchievementsExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'TCS has long embedded ESG principles into its core business strategy, thereby future proofing its operations. We are committed to responsible environmental stewardship through focused efforts on managing climate impacts, enabling efficient resource use, and advancing decarbonization and circularity across all our operations.\nWe continue to create meaningful social value through impactful initiatives in education, literacy, entrepreneurship, employment, health and wellness, and skill development while fostering an employee-centric culture grounded in well-being, continuous learning, and responsible employment practices.\n\nOur commitment to high standards of ethical conduct, transparency, and strong corporate governance remains steadfast, guiding our ongoing ESG journey to deliver lasting, positive outcomes for society and the environment.\n\nK. Krithivasan\nChief Executive Officer and Managing Director (CEO & MD)\n\nTo read more about TCS’ ESG Principles, Material Topics and Initiatives, kindly refer to the Sustainability Disclosures section, which forms part of this Integrated Annual Report.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: StatementByDirectorResponsibleForTheBusinessResponsibilityReportHighlightingESGRelatedChallengesTargetsAndAchievementsExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfTheHighestAuthorityResponsibleForImplementationAndOversightOfTheBusinessResponsibilityPolicyExplanatoryTextBlock' (DetailsOfTheHighestAuthorityResponsibleForImplementationAndOversightOfTheBusinessResponsibilityPolicyExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'Sudeep Kunnumal, Chief Human Resources Officer'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DetailsOfTheHighestAuthorityResponsibleForImplementationAndOversightOfTheBusinessResponsibilityPolicyExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DoesTheEntityHaveASpecifiedCommitteeOfTheBoardOrDirectorResponsibleForDecisionMakingOnSustainabilityRelatedIssues' (DoesTheEntityHaveASpecifiedCommitteeOfTheBoardOrDirectorResponsibleForDecisionMakingOnSustainabilityRelatedIssues) is 'Yes'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DoesTheEntityHaveASpecifiedCommitteeOfTheBoardOrDirectorResponsibleForDecisionMakingOnSustainabilityRelatedIssues, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfSpecifiedCommitteeOfTheBoardOrDirectorResponsibleForDecisionMakingOnSustainabilityRelatedIssuesExplanatoryTextBlock' (DetailsOfSpecifiedCommitteeOfTheBoardOrDirectorResponsibleForDecisionMakingOnSustainabilityRelatedIssuesExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'The Stakeholders’ Relationship Committee (SRC) and Corporate Social Responsibility (CSR) Committee of the Board is responsible for decision making on sustainability related issues.\nRefer to Corporate Governance Report which forms part of this Integrated Annual Report for additional information on SRC and CSR Committee.'.",
