  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'PercentageOfRAndD' (PercentageOfRAndD) is '0.011' xbrli:pure.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: PercentageOfRAndD, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'PercentageOfRAndD' (PercentageOfRAndD) is '0.01' xbrli:pure.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: PercentageOfRAndD, Context: DPYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfImprovementsInEnvironmentalAndSocialImpactsDueToRAndD' (DetailsOfImprovementsInEnvironmentalAndSocialImpactsDueToRAndD) is 'Research and Innovation at the Company drives\nenvironmental and social impact through targeted\ninvestments in clean energy, eco designed materials,\nsmart cities, precision health, accessibility AI and digital\nagriculture to cite a few examples. Innovations in digital\ntwins, green hydrogen, carbon reduction, healthcare AI\nand inclusive platforms accelerate energy transition,\nreduce waste and emissions, strengthen ecosystem\nresilience and improve health, well being & livelihoods at\npopulation scale.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DetailsOfImprovementsInEnvironmentalAndSocialImpactsDueToRAndD, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'PercentageOfCapex' (PercentageOfCapex) is '0.018' xbrli:pure.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: PercentageOfCapex, Context: DCYMain)"
