    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfImprovementsInEnvironmentalAndSocialImpactsDueToCapex' (DetailsOfImprovementsInEnvironmentalAndSocialImpactsDueToCapex) is 'Capital investments in infrastructure, including energy\nefficiency and other environmental initiatives.'.",
