  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'WebLinkOfEqualOppertunityPolicyTextBlock' (WebLinkOfEqualOppertunityPolicyTextBlock) is 'Yes. TCS has a Disability Inclusion (Equal Opportunity) policy as per the RPWD Act 2016. This adds on to the impact of TCS Global Diversity, Equity & Inclusion policy and The Tata Code of Conduct, which can be accessed at: https://www.tcs.com/tatacode-of-conduct.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: WebLinkOfEqualOppertunityPolicyTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
