  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DescribeTheInternalMechanismsInPlaceToRedressGrievancesRelatedToHumanRightsIssuesExplanatoryTextBlock' (DescribeTheInternalMechanismsInPlaceToRedressGrievancesRelatedToHumanRightsIssuesExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'Reporting avenues have been provided to employees, customers, suppliers, and other stakeholders to raise concerns or make disclosures when they become aware of any actual or potential violation of the Company Code, policies or law including human rights violations. Non-permanent employees can raise the grievances via email to the stakeholders concerned. Additionally, anybody can make protected disclosures under the company’s Whistle Blower policy. Representations made on the reporting avenues are reviewed and appropriate action is taken on substantiated violations.'.",
