  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MechanismsToPreventAdverseConsequencesToTheComplainantInDiscriminationAndHarassmentCasesExplanatoryTextBlock' (MechanismsToPreventAdverseConsequencesToTheComplainantInDiscriminationAndHarassmentCasesExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'Concerns on discrimination and harassment are dealt with confidentially. The Company does not tolerate any form of retaliation against anyone reporting good faith concerns. Anyone involved in targeting such a person raising such complaints will be subject to disciplinary action.'.",
