    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'NameOfTheExternalAgencyThatUndertookIndependentAssessmentOrEvaluationOrAssuranceForTotalScope3EmissionsExplanatoryTextBlock' (NameOfTheExternalAgencyThatUndertookIndependentAssessmentOrEvaluationOrAssuranceForTotalScope3EmissionsExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'Yes. Independent assurance has been carried out by KPMG.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: NameOfTheExternalAgencyThatUndertookIndependentAssessmentOrEvaluationOrAssuranceForTotalScope3EmissionsExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfSignificantDirectAndIndirectImpactOfTheEntityOnBiodiversityInSuchAreasAlongWithPreventionAndRemediationActivitiesExplanatoryTextBlock' (DetailsOfSignificantDirectAndIndirectImpactOfTheEntityOnBiodiversityInSuchAreasAlongWithPreventionAndRemediationActivitiesExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'Initiative undertaken: Chandaka Wildlife sanctuary authority has developed the trench\nfollowed by 5 feet wall with fencing along the border of the sanctuary so that the possibility of elephants\ncrossing the trench is eliminated hence, any impact of the Company’s operations on wildlife is not expected. However, the Company has undertaken following initiatives:\n• Minimizing light pollution around the wildlife sanctuary\n• Internal initiatives within its campus towards biodiversity conservation and enhancement\n• Internal initiatives toward swater and waste management\n\nDetails of the initiative (Weblink, if any, may be provided along-with summary): \n\n• Installation of inward facing low intensity peripheral lights\n• Plantation of native/ indigenous plants, medicinal and spice garden, butterfly garden\n• Provision of organic waste technologies- Vermicomposting and organic waste converter\n• Provision of rainwater harvesting structure and sewage treatment plant (STP)\n\nOutcome of the initiative:\n\n• Inward direction peripheral lights of low intensity to avoid any impact on wildlife movement.\n• High mast lights in the Company's parking area are switched off after 11 pm. This helps avoid discomfort which may cause due to light pollution for the nocturnal wildlife.\n• Protection of native/medicinal, plant species and providing feeding and egg laying areas for butterfly species.\n• Garden and food waste vermicomposting and organic waste composting technology has been installed to generate organic manure and it is reused for landscaping.\n• Better waste management reduces wildlife encounters.\n• 100% treatment and recycling of wastewater inside the premises.\n• Groundwater recharging pits for enriching the water table.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DetailsOfSignificantDirectAndIndirectImpactOfTheEntityOnBiodiversityInSuchAreasAlongWithPreventionAndRemediationActivitiesExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DoesTheEntityHaveABusinessContinuityAndDisasterManagementPlan' (DoesTheEntityHaveABusinessContinuityAndDisasterManagementPlan) is 'Yes'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DoesTheEntityHaveABusinessContinuityAndDisasterManagementPlan, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[As of 2026-03-31] Fact: The value for 'DisclosureWebLinkOfEntityAtWhichBusinessContinuityAndDisasterManagementPlanIsPlaced' (DisclosureWebLinkOfEntityAtWhichBusinessContinuityAndDisasterManagementPlanIsPlaced) is 'The Business Continuity and Disaster Management (BCM) functions safeguards organisational interests and supports strategic objectives by proactively enhancing resilience against internal and external threats. It ensures uninterrupted delivery of critical business operations during disruptions through a comprehensive, end-to-end framework comprising defined policies, procedures, guidelines, and in-house tools for capturing entire BCM framework and Crisis communication. The framework is fully compliant with ISO 22301:2019, CMMI-SVC standards and seamlessly integrated with the Company’s Integrated Quality Management System for consistent deployment across the organisation. This robust approach strengthens preparedness and response capabilities, enabling business continuity and operational excellence.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DisclosureWebLinkOfEntityAtWhichBusinessContinuityAndDisasterManagementPlanIsPlaced, Context: ICYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DiscloseAnySignificantAdverseImpactToTheEnvironmentArisingFromTheValueChainOfTheEntityWhatMitigationOrAdaptationMeasuresHaveBeenTakenByTheEntityInThisRegardExplanatoryTextBlock' (DiscloseAnySignificantAdverseImpactToTheEnvironmentArisingFromTheValueChainOfTheEntityWhatMitigationOrAdaptationMeasuresHaveBeenTakenByTheEntityInThisRegardExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'No significant adverse impact reported from the Company’s value chain.'.",
