  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'PublicPolicyAdvocated' (PublicPolicyAdvocated) is 'Trade:\nEngaged on core services trade aspects critical to TCS across key geographies, strengthening for Indian IT and digital services.\nKey Pillars:\nFTA / BTA discussions (India–UK CETA)\nWTO Moratorium (MC14)\nWorkforce Mobility\nBilateral understanding on Labour matters like Social Security arrangement & Totalization agreement'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: PublicPolicyAdvocated, Context: D_PublicPolicyAxis1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MethodResortedForSuchAdvocacy' (MethodResortedForSuchAdvocacy) is 'Engagement with industry\nassociations through\nmeetings, seminars, and\nconferences to provide\nthought leadership and\ncontribute to discussions on\ntrade related matters.\nParticipation in B2B and\nB2G dialogues within\nformal business forums and\ngovernment committees\nto support informed policy\ndeliberations.\nTrade bodyled submissions\nand advocacy initiatives on\nservices trade, undertaken\nin coordination with global\nstakeholders.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MethodResortedForSuchAdvocacy, Context: D_PublicPolicyAxis1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'WhetherInformationAvailableInPublicDomain' (WhetherInformationAvailableInPublicDomain) is 'true'.",
