  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DescribeTheMechanismsToReceiveAndRedressGrievancesOfTheCommunityExplanatoryTextBlock' (DescribeTheMechanismsToReceiveAndRedressGrievancesOfTheCommunityExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'The Company has established structured mechanisms to enable communities to raise concerns and seek redressal through formal grievance clauses embedded in all stakeholder agreements. Regional Leaders maintain ground level engagement, ensuring timely identification and resolution of issues. Post implementation surveys and consultations capture community feedback, which is reviewed and integrated into program improvements. Grievances can also be addressed through the Company’s governance\nanchored system detailed in the Global CSR Policy (https://on.tcs.com/Global-CSR-Policy). As per disclosures, no community grievances were recorded or pending during the reporting period.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DescribeTheMechanismsToReceiveAndRedressGrievancesOfTheCommunityExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
